  tau (j = -i sqrt11): u = (0.336895498784 + 0.94154204521j), N = 6.2909572501505091541, 37/15 < N < 59/20: False, R = 4 - N = -2.29095725015051, D = 1 - 4/N = 0.364166717250495
  (at the intended embedding R > 0, so h = sqrt(R) is real and conj fixes h; D < 0 so s is imaginary and conj s = -s)
